Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:04.15,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some homes keep pace with Tel Aviv.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:06.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,This one also knows how to close the door on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:11.63,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  MORNING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.63,0:00:13.18,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:09.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Morning in Kochav HaTzafon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:17.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,You step out of a brand-new boutique building into one of the quietest, greenest neighbourhoods in north Tel Aviv.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:22.66,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE NEIGHBOURHOOD CENTRE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:22.21,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:25.46,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.51,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:29.56,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,A minute's walk away is the neighbourhood centre:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:28.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,the deli, fresh bread, the nut shop, the supermarket, and coffee with friends who live around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:33.73,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE BRIDGE TO YARKON PARK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:34.28,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Planned bridge · illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:38.60,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Planned bridge · 3D illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:47.32,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Planned bridge · illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.03,0:00:32.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is what changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:39.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new bridge for walking and cycling, a hundred and seventy metres long, is being built over Rokach Boulevard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:46.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it opens in 2027, you walk straight from the neighbourhood into Yarkon Park, without crossing a single road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:51.50,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  YARKON PARK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.65,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:53.90,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.85,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:50.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Almost four thousand dunams of park:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:57.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,running paths along the river, cycling, tennis, the sports centre, and long Saturdays on the lawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:02.00,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE HOME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back home, almost two hundred square metres on the eleventh floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bespoke joinery, a designer kitchen, a master suite with an open view of the Tel Aviv skyline, and a children's suite that looks out to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:17.87,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE TERRACE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:25.42,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then the real living room:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,a seventy-four square metre sun terrace, open on three sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Made for long evenings, a grill, and friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:29.57,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE NUMBERS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:37.42,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:56.07,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:27.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,The numbers matter too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Homes in Kochav HaTzafon average around fifty thousand shekels per square metre, and new homes here reach ninety thousand and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:41.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,To the north, the Sde Dov quarter is adding sixteen thousand new homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:54.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Technion study of Yarkon Park found that homes closest to the park are worth more, and around the world, new park links have lifted nearby home values by five to twenty percent, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:02:01.59,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Planned bridge · 3D illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:02:00.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,A home with Tel Aviv on one side and the park on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,For a private viewing, call Meital Katzir.
